              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "senthan balachandiran"
            },
            "datePublished": "2025-12-31",
            "reviewBody": "We had a very professional organised tour with the team at JV. Our tour guide Gufron - was super friendly and made sure all our needs were taken care off...his knowledge of the area was also great. Our drive Joyo knows how to get from A to B in the fastest time possible! We did the 5/6 night tour but in hindsight the 4/5 night tour would have given us all the highlights of the region. I would use this company again - they are very professional and their online dashboard gives you all the information you need.",
            "reviewRating": {
