            },
            "datePublished": "2025-05-15",
            "reviewBody": "We had a fantastic tour experience with Gufron as our guide and Joyo as our driver. Gufron was incredibly knowledgeable and friendly throughout the entire trip, making every stop more meaningful with his insights and stories. Very accommodating to our hiking pace, allowing us to enjoy the journey without feeling rushed. He also gave us excellent food recommendations that allowed us to enjoy authentic local flavors!",
